dsh-devin-search is independent of DeepSeek Harness, Devin/Windsurf and piwin.

Protocol field numbers, role encoding, OAuth endpoint/PKCE conventions and
completion message design were adapted from these MIT-licensed piwin sources:
  packages/agent-host/src/devin/oauth.ts
  packages/tools-web/src/devin-search-provider.ts
  packages/host-runtime/src/code-search/backends/windsurf-protobuf.ts
  packages/host-runtime/src/code-search/backends/windsurf-protocol.ts
  packages/host-runtime/src/code-search/completion-port.ts
Copyright (c) 2026 Piwin contributors. See LICENSE for the MIT permission notice.

The implementation is a smaller independent client with strict framing,
bounded IO and an allowlisted local search loop. It imports no piwin package
and reads no piwin credential file. DSH service integration was checked against
DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-alpha.1, reference commit
5badb15009ae1756c3afe0ae0cef1faafc290ccc (MIT).

Offline fixtures do not establish compatibility with a live provider, account
entitlements, service availability, prices, or continued authorization.
